# Camera IDs for the Note 10+ (read by our camera service: the "(hybris)"
# patch in frameworks/av CameraProviderManager.cpp).
#
# Samsung's stock camera provider (vendor.samsung.hardware.camera.provider@3.0)
# returns only IDs 0-3 from getCameraIdList():
#   0  back main        4.3 mm, 12 MP
#   1  front, 16:9 crop 6.5 MP at 4:3, no 4K video
#   2  back ultra-wide  1.8 mm, 16 MP
#   3  front, full      10 MP, 4K video
# The 2x telephoto is ID 52, the ID LineageOS' own provider adds for every
# exynos9820 model except the S10e. Offer it too, and hide the cropped front
# ID 1 so apps, which take the first camera of each facing, use the full
# 10 MP front sensor. Resulting API1 camera numbers: 0 main, 1 ultra-wide,
# 2 front, 3 telephoto.
on early-init
    setprop ro.camera.extra_ids 52
    setprop ro.camera.hidden_ids 1
